{"version":1,"content":"<p>根據周二公佈的最新招股書，Anthropic的七名聯合創始人將在下周的首次公開募股中合計出售價值17.5億美元的股票。按IPO發行價區間中點計算，每位聯合創始人擬出售價值約2.5億美元的股票。據億萬富翁指數，按這一估值計算，每人的淨資產將達到約180億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585846.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:27:23.062040+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:13:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:20:40.290447+00:00","content_hash":"b6ce46809943285fd8b638d6c09b9302d405e854ca1c0c9267604ab48166e720","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}